Acceptance makes a triage Ticket eligible for
.BR "tk next" .
It requires an explicit Priority only when unset; otherwise it keeps the
stored Priority unless overridden.
.PP
An already accepted Ticket succeeds without a Priority argument and refuses
an explicit one; use
.B tk update
to change its Priority. Use
.B tk unpark
for a parked Ticket.
.PP
Selection State stays local. A changed Priority on a Backend-bound Ticket
queues a Mutation in the same transaction as acceptance.
